                        <summary>
                            
                            <p>This records the assignment of one Aḻagapperumāḷ <hi rend="italic">alias</hi> Śoṭṭaikkōṉ for the maintenance of a perpetual lamp in the temple of Tirumāḍaippēṟuḍaiya-Nāyaṉār at Eyyil. This is signed at the end, among others, by Duvārapativēḷāṉ, probably the same person mentioned in No. <ref target="DHARMA_INSSIIv22p0i0223.xml">223</ref> above.</p>						
                            
                        </summary>
                    </msContents>
